    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a loop. no matter what i do, the debt just grows and the shame gets worse. i look at my kids and i just feel like a monster for putting them in this position. honestly, it feels like the only logical way to actually stop the damage and let everyone move on is for me to just... not be here anymore. it feels like the only way to protect them from the mess i made.",
